{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>באורך</b> Three times in the Masorah: דין (this one) ואידך וייף בגדלו באורך דליותיו · בארך אפים · פותה קצין. Meaning: בארך אפים — the Mishkan, concerning which it is stated באורך יריעות האהל. פותה קצין — that the Holy One, blessed be He, was persuaded and reconciled to Israel and atoned for them for the sin of the calf, and Israel became beautified and became great on account of all [this], that He caused His Shekhinah to dwell among them, and this is [the meaning of] וייף בגדלו באורך — that it became beautified and became great like the earth, like the Mishkan, concerning which is written באורך."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {0 "The three Masorah citations are rendered exactly as they appear in Hebrew; באורך דליותיו and פותה קצין appear to be partial or variant phrase citations from other verses, preserved as written."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:14:30.671800542Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}